"However, we are maintaining our guidance range as we expect increased loan loss provisions in the fourth quarter of this year as we undertake an annual recalibration of our mortgage loan loss provision model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/09/banco-santander-san-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2019 Q4","e":"san","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sergio Gamez Martinez","x":"We generated about EUR200 million net cost savings, that is about 20% of the EUR1 billion net cost savings target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/banco-santander-sa-san-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2019 Q4","e":"san","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez Alvarez","x":"Restructuring costs in several countries, EUR140 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/banco-santander-sa-san-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2019 Q4","e":"san","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Andrea Unzueta","x":"We reiterate the guidance of Mexico, Brazil, somewhere around 20%, 21% return on tangible equity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/banco-santander-sa-san-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q1","e":"san","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez Alvarez","x":"The nonrecurring charge of EUR1.6 billion correspond to the already mentioned provision overlay and the remaining amount of restructuring costs that you have in more detail in the appendix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/banco-santander-sa-san-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q1","e":"san","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Garcia Cantera","x":"We had slightly lower net income, although profit before tax was up as cost savings offset the drop in total revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/banco-santander-sa-san-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q2","e":"san","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"Strong top-line performance given the current market context, with a net operating income increase of 2%, driven by resilient customer revenue and our cost reduction plan, minus 5% year on year in real terms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q2","e":"san","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"We accelerate our cost reduction, and higher loan loss provisions due to COVID-19-related provisions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q3","e":"san","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"The pre-provision profit under this scenario and I want to stress you this, in constant euros, grew 3%, driven by resilient customer revenue and our cost-reduction plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q3","e":"san","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"We accelerate our cost reduction, and we have good news, good perspectives for the coming quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q4","e":"san","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ana Botin","x":"And importantly, we have generated 1 billion net cost savings excluding perimeter in the last two years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2020 Q4","e":"san","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio","x":"We accelerate our cost reduction and we expect to keep on track in this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q1","e":"san","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"In addition, we recorded an expected restructuring charge for the whole year, for the whole 2021, EUR 530 million net of taxes, resulting in an attributable profit of EUR 1.6 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q1","e":"san","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"Finally, we recorded EUR 330 million expected restructuring charges for the year as a whole, mainly in U.K., around EUR 300 million, Portugal, around EUR 160 million; and Corporate Centre and others around the remaining EUR 70 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q2","e":"san","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"As you know, we did a charge for restructuring costs in the first Q. So the underlying profit was EUR 4.2 billion, the largest since 2010.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q2","e":"san","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"Recall that we recorded the EUR 530 million restructuring cost in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q3","e":"san","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"Recall that we recorded 530 million restructuring costs in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q3","e":"san","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"In Europe, costs were 1.5% lower, making headway in our cost-reduction plan, which we expected to accelerate in the coming quarters increasing synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q3","e":"san","d":"2021-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Alvaro Serrano","x":"You gave that 1 billion cost-cutting guidance in Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q4","e":"san","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ana Botin","x":"We believe our 2015, '21 strong performance, step-by-step, delivering every year, our commitment to be radically improving our profitability through capital allocation to achieving cost savings through structural changes will be very important and will make us a winner in the digital age.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2021 Q4","e":"san","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francisco Riquel","x":"And also in developed markets, you admitted the EUR 1 billion cost-cutting target is challenging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2022 Q1","e":"san","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Alvarez","x":"Remember that last year, we bring around EUR 500 million restructuring costs that we don't have this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/27/banco-santander-central-hispano-san-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"SAN 2022 Q1","e":"san","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"managemen